  "liner": {
   "body_md": "This recording captures the Mountain Goats performing live at the Theater Kikker in Utrecht on Sunday, November 10, 1996 [1]. The audio file, identified as tmg1996-11-10, contains a single track that runs for approximately sixty-two minutes [1]. This specific performance is the only archived recording of the band from this particular date and venue [1]. Within the broader collection of Mountain Goats materials available on the Internet Archive, this show is listed as the twelfth entry out of a total of 467 archived performances [2]. The previous archived show in the sequence took place on November 9, 1996, at the Zwijnzicht in Dordrecht [2]. The setlist for this concert includes a song designated as mountain1, which is noted as the first in the archive and considered legendary because it is the only archived performance of that specific material [1]. The source for the recording is not explicitly stated in the available metadata [1]. Listeners seeking a glimpse of the band's live presence in Utrecht during the mid-nineties will find this solitary, lengthy track to be the definitive audio document of their appearance there [1]. The file serves as the primary and only recommended recording for this event, offering a complete, albeit single-track, view of the evening's musical output [1].",
